  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that configurations using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_031: 72.5% accuracy) and transformer aggregation perform best. This experiment tests scvi_n200 with resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion, which could potentially improve accuracy by leveraging resnet50's features. It balances exploration of image encoder alternatives with the proven effectiveness of scvi_n200, while keeping cost manageable (estimated ~8-9 GPU hours)."
